or":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":21,"created_at":"2026-01-16T13:10:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T09:49:20Z","closed_at":"2026-01-19T09:49:20Z","assignee":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducable in:\n4.6dev 6\n4.6beta 1\n4.6beta 2\n4.6beta 3\n4.6rc 1\n\nNot reproducable in:\n4.5 official\n4.6 dev1-5\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev6 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 3GB (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8180) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-6400 CPU @ 2.70GHz (4 threads) - 15.95 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nSome change that happened between dev5 and dev6 made it so new shader materials use up roughly 6.5x as much RAM. Godot 4.5 official has the same behaviour as 4.6dev 5 (low memory usage)\n\nGodot 4.6 dev6 (same for newer) video. High ram usage\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d925c35-dcaa-4d7c-a489-6da6fd92f142\n\nGodot 4.6 dev5 video. Low ram usage\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/44d6b475-636b-414c-8f8b-e6712741c5c1\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCheck the repro project but the idea is just to spawn new shader materials with unique shaders\n\nThe code below spawns a new MeshInstance3D with 10 material slots and fills each material slot with a unique shader material\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node3D\n\nconst TEN_MATS_PLANE_RIGGED_PLANE = preload(\"res://TenMatsPlaneRiggedMesh.tres\")\nconst TEST_SHADER = preload(\"res://TestShader.gdshader\")\n\n@onready var memory_label: Label = %MemoryLabel\n\nvar planeAmount:int = 0\nvar shaderAmount:int = 0\n\nfunc _on_add_button_pressed() -> void:\n\tvar theMem:float = Performance.get_monitor(Performance.MEMORY_STATIC)\n\t\n\tvar newMeshInstance := MeshInstance3D.new()\n\tnewMeshInstance.mesh = TEN_MATS_PLANE_RIGGED_PLANE\n\tnewMeshInstance.position.y = planeAmount*0.1\n\t\n\tfor _i in 10: # Mesh has 10 material slots\n\t\tvar theShaderMat := ShaderMaterial.new()\n\t\tvar newShader := TEST_SHADER.duplicate(true) # Copying the shader 10 times\n\t\t\n\t\ttheShaderMat.shader = newShader\n\t\tnewMeshInstance.set_surface_override_material(_i, theShaderMat)\n\t\tshaderAmount += 1\n\n\tadd_child(newMeshInstance)\n\tplaneAmount += 1\n\t\n\tvar theMemDiff:float = Performance.get_monitor(Performance.MEMORY_STATIC) - theMem\n\tprint(\"+\"+str((theMemDiff/1024.0/1024.0)).pad_decimals(2)+\" MB\")\n\nfunc _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n\tmemory_label.text = \"RAM: \"+str(Performance.get_monitor(Performance.MEMORY_STATIC)/1024.0/1024.0).pad_decimals(2)+\" MB   GPU: \" + str(Performance.get_monitor(Performance.RENDER_VIDEO_MEM_USED)/1024.0/1024.0).pad_decimals(2)+\" MB   Shaders: \"+str(shaderAmount)\n\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[shadermemoryissue_2026-01-16_16-05-59.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24672539/shadermemoryissue_2026-01-16_16-05-59.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115032/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115032/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}